<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman to buy 50 pct of Stratton Paper.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman to buy 50 pct of Stratton Paper.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company AssiDoman said on Monday that it was to buy Cyprus-based investment group Daventree's 50 percent of Stratton Paper Co, a joint venture company that holds a 57 percent stake of Russian paper mill Segezhabumprom.</p>
</text>
